abstract: >-
  An event-sourced memory substrate for AI agents: an immutable append-only
  log as the single source of truth, materialized views rebuilt by
  deterministic replay, learned product-manifold geometry, ACT-R activation,
  and consolidation as LSM-style compaction with total provenance.
